questions.question:
This JavaScript function should split an array into chunks of `size` elements, but the last chunk is sometimes missing. Return the corrected function in a ```javascript code block.

```javascript
function chunk(arr, size) {
  const out = [];
  for (let i = 0; i < arr.length - size; i += size) {
    out.push(arr.slice(i, i + size));
  }
  return out;
}
```

